    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Epic Boon Feat (Prerequisite: Level 19+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Constitution, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 30.</p><p><strong>Daylight Presence.</strong> As a Bonus Action, you radiate a 30-foot Emanation of Bright Light that is sunlight. If any part of it overlaps an area of Darkness created by a spell, that spell is dispelled. The Emanation lasts until you dismiss it (no action required), die, or have the Incapacitated condition.</p><p><strong>Fortifying Light.</strong> While your Daylight Presence is active, at the start of each of your turns, you and the allies you can see in it gain 10 Temporary Hit Points.</p>",
